Third-party components
======================

Q7 Chat depends on open-source packages. The direct dependencies and their
licenses are listed below. Transitive dependencies and their full license
texts are recorded in package-lock.json and in each package's distribution.

Runtime dependencies
--------------------

- next (MIT)
- react (MIT)
- react-dom (MIT)
- lucide-react (ISC)
- qrcode (MIT)
- jsqr (Apache-2.0)

Development dependencies
------------------------

- typescript (Apache-2.0)
- vitest (MIT)
- fake-indexeddb (Apache-2.0)
- tailwindcss (MIT)
- postcss (MIT)
- autoprefixer (MIT)
- @types/node, @types/qrcode, @types/react, @types/react-dom (MIT)

